Fixes for PR #12 (cursor/remove-intro-fireworks-5000) so the CI "check" job passes.
Made against commit 515f965. From the repo root, on the PR branch, run:

    git apply pr-12-ci-fixes.patch

then review, commit and push.

What it changes
- Lint: DiyaLighting no longer writes refs during render or calls setState in
  an effect; the lit-state helpers move to src/components/diya-lit.ts so the
  component file only exports a component. The "CC" label comes from locales.
- Formatting: Prettier applied to Fireworks, Fuljadi, Icon and PrasangVideo.
- End-to-end: video bar buttons are var(--tap) (44px) instead of 36px; the
  captions button's accessible name now contains its visible "CC" text
  ("CC subtitles on/off"); tests expect /bhulkao/scenario/homework-time and
  no Placeholder badge on Yuvako Prasang.

